  #line-at(54pt, 96.96pt, "blocks, as well as for the design of complex structures such as the geodesic dome. However, it is based ")
  #line-at(54pt, 110.76pt, "on energy minimization and is designed to compute liquid volumes at steady state. As discussed in the ")
  #line-at(54pt, 124.56pt, "experimental section, the hollow partitioned structures (Fig. 2e-h) are inherently not at steady state; their ")
  #line-at(54pt, 138.36pt, "thin partitions represent an extremely slow-draining process that is effectively frozen by polymerization. ")
  #line-at(54pt, 152.16pt, "Predicting such transient structures would therefore require a fundamentally different, time-dependent ")
